# Skeleton WordPress Theme

## Project Config

- **Text Domain**: `skel`
- **Function Prefix**: `skel_`
- **Indent**: Tabs (not spaces)
- **PHP Version**: 8.0+
- **WordPress**: 6.x
- **ACF Pro**: Required

## Tech Stack

- WordPress with ACF Pro blocks
- Vanilla JavaScript (NO jQuery)
- SCSS with fluid typography
- Swiper.js for sliders
- Lenis for smooth scroll
- AOS for scroll animations

## File Structure

```
acf-blocks/{slug}.php           # Block template
src/sass/partials/acf-blocks/_{slug}.scss  # Block styles
src/js/custom/acf-blocks/{slug}.js         # Block JS (if needed)
functions/                       # PHP includes
template-parts/                  # Reusable partials
```

## Naming Conventions

| Type             | Convention     | Example                |
| ---------------- | -------------- | ---------------------- |
| PHP functions    | `skel_` prefix | `skel_get_phone_url()` |
| PHP variables    | snake_case     | `$post_thumbnail_id`   |
| JS variables     | camelCase      | `const sliderElement`  |
| JS state classes | `js-` prefix   | `js-active`, `js-open` |
| CSS sections     | `*-section`    | `hero-section`         |
| CSS blocks       | `*-block`      | `content-block`        |

## Critical Rules

### SCSS - Always Use

```scss
gap: rem-calc(16); // Fixed spacing
font-size: fluid(16, 24); // Responsive values
@media (width >= $md) {
} // Mobile-first breakpoints
```

### PHP - Always Escape

```php
echo esc_html( $text );
echo esc_attr( $attribute );
echo esc_url( $url );
echo wp_kses_post( $html );
```

### JavaScript - Pattern

```javascript
(() => {
	const el = document.querySelector('.element');
	if (!el) return;
	// Logic here
})();
```

## Forbidden

- ❌ Inline styles
- ❌ jQuery
- ❌ `!important` in CSS
- ❌ `px` units (except borders < 4px)
- ❌ Spaces for indentation
- ❌ `var` in JavaScript

## Data Attributes

| Attribute                  | Purpose              |
| -------------------------- | -------------------- |
| `data-inview`              | Viewport trigger     |
| `data-aos="fade-up"`       | Scroll animation     |
| `data-aos-stagger-item`    | Stagger children     |
| `data-toggle-click="name"` | Click toggle         |
| `data-toggle-link="name"`  | Linked toggle target |
| `data-toggle-group="name"` | Toggle group         |

## ACF Block Registration

Add to `functions/register-acf-blocks.php`:

```php
$block_types = array( 'Existing Block', 'New Block Name' );
$blocks_with_js = array( 'New Block Name' );  // Only if needs JS
```

Files auto-generate on save in local environment.

## Helper Functions

- `svg( 'icon-name', ['class' => 'icon'] )` - SVG icon
- `skel_get_phone_url( '+1234567890' )` - Tel: URL
- `skel_get_the_excerpt( 20 )` - Truncated excerpt
- `skel_direction_class()` - RTL/LTR class
- `skel_swiper_direction_class()` - Swiper RTL class

## Standards Files

Detailed standards in `.cursor/rules/`:

- `php-standards.mdc` - PHP/WordPress
- `javascript-standards.mdc` - Vanilla JS
- `scss-standards.mdc` - SCSS/CSS
- `accessibility.mdc` - A11y
- `project-patterns.mdc` - Theme patterns
- `acf-fields.mdc` - ACF field structures
- `helpers-reference.mdc` - Helper functions
- `snippets.mdc` - Code snippets
